data: {"id": "ce4829f0b465421e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1047", "run_id": "ce4829f0b465421e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已提供的工具结果，我对 `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84` 的当前状态和证据分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **Pod Name**: `workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84`\n*   **Namespace**: `aiops-case-10`\n*   **Node**: `node2`\n*   **IP**: `172.16.104.17`\n*   **状态**: 确认处于 **CrashLoopBackOff** 状态 (0/1 Ready, 21次重启)。\n\n### 2. 支持“CrashLoopBackOff”的事实\n*   **事件确认**: `kubectl_events` 返回明确的 `Warning BackOff` 事件：`Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload-79d9f8fd88-bsn84`，时间跨度为过去 52 分钟，频率为 x175。\n*   **容器退出码**: `kubectl_descri", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789097694866, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

